msgctxt "story layout"
msgid "Magazine"
msgstr "杂志"

msgid "Magazine view layout showing story cards with thumbnails"
msgstr "杂志视图布局，显示带缩略图的文章卡片"

msgid ""
"Make NewsBlur yours. Choose from light, dark, and auto themes across web, iOS, and Android. Customize your "
"reading experience with multiple font choices, five text sizes, adjustable line spacing, compact or "
"comfortable density, and image preview styles. Every setting can be different per-feed, so each site looks "
"exactly the way you want it."
msgstr ""
"让 NewsBlur 成为你的专属体验。在网页、iOS 和 Android "
"上选择浅色、深色或自动主题。你可以通过多种字体、五种字号、可调行距、紧凑或舒适的布局密度，以及图片预览样式来定制阅读体验。每项设置都可以按订阅源单独调整，让每个网站都呈现出你想要的样子。"

msgid "Make your blurblog private so only you can see your shared stories. Control who sees what you're reading."
msgstr "将你的 Blurblog 设为私密，仅自己可查看分享的文章。掌控谁能看到你的阅读内容。"

msgid "Maker"
msgstr "创客"

msgid "Manage NewsBlur"
msgstr "管理 NewsBlur"

msgid "Manage feeds and folders"
msgstr "管理订阅源和文件夹"

msgid "Manage feeds and stories from your terminal"
msgstr "从终端管理订阅源和文章"

msgid ""
"Manage your NewsBlur from the terminal. Read feeds, search stories, manage subscriptions, and train "
"classifiers. Pipe to jq, script your workflows, and automate with <code>--json</code> output. Works with "
"self-hosted instances too."
msgstr "在终端中管理你的 NewsBlur。阅读订阅源、搜索文章、管理订阅并训练分类器。通过管道传递给 jq，编写工作流脚本，并使用 <code>--json</code> 输出实现自动化。也支持自托管实例。"

msgid "Manual config required"
msgstr "需要手动配置"

msgid ""
"Many RSS feeds only include a summary or the first paragraph. Text view extracts the full story from the "
"original website and displays it right in NewsBlur, with clean formatting and no clutter. Read full "
"articles without leaving your reader."
msgstr "许多 RSS 订阅源只包含摘要或首段。文本视图会从原网站提取完整文章，并直接显示在 NewsBlur 中，排版清晰、不含杂乱内容。无需离开阅读器即可阅读全文。"

msgid "Mark all as read"
msgstr "全部标记为已读"

msgid "Mark read by hash, feed, or folder"
msgstr "按哈希值、订阅源或文件夹标记为已读"

msgid ""
"Mark stories as read, save stories with tags and notes, subscribe to new feeds, share stories to your "
"blurblog"
msgstr "将文章标记为已读，使用标签和备注保存文章，订阅新订阅源，并将文章分享到你的 Blurblog"

msgid "Migrating is easy with OPML import"
msgstr "通过 OPML 导入，迁移轻而易举"

msgid "Minimal (Go binary: 128 MB)"
msgstr "极低（Go 二进制文件：128 MB）"

