msgid ""
"Readwise Reader is an all-in-one reading app that combines RSS feeds, read-later articles, PDFs, EPUBs, and"
" email newsletters with deep highlighting and annotation. It's built for people who want everything in one "
"place and care deeply about taking notes on what they read. NewsBlur is a dedicated RSS reader built for "
"people who follow many feeds and want intelligent filtering to surface what matters. If your primary need "
"is RSS with powerful training and filtering, NewsBlur is the sharper tool for the job."
msgstr ""
"Readwise Reader 是一款一体化阅读应用，将 RSS 订阅源、稍后阅读文章、PDF、EPUB "
"和电子邮件新闻简报整合在一起，并提供深入的高亮和注释功能。它专为希望一站式管理所有内容，并重视阅读笔记的人打造。NewsBlur 是一款专用 RSS "
"阅读器，专为关注大量订阅源并希望通过智能筛选发现重要内容的人打造。如果你主要需要 RSS，以及强大的训练和筛选功能，NewsBlur 会是更合适的工具。"

