msgid "Your archived stories remain accessible, but new stories follow the standard retention policy."
msgstr "你已归档的文章仍可访问，但新文章将遵循标准保留政策。"

msgid "Your archived stories remain accessible, but new stories will start following the standard retention policy."
msgstr "已归档的文章仍可访问，但新文章将按照标准保留政策处理。"

msgid ""
"Your complete news archive with AI-powered intelligence. 4,096 sites, full story archive, Ask AI, and daily"
